1.14.m:
To Intention, to the Yoker, to Agni, svāhā!
To Wisdom, to Mind, to Agni, svāhā!
To Consecration, to Ascetic Fervor, to Agni, svāhā!
To Sarasvatī, to Pūṣan, to Agni, svāhā!
O divine, lofty waters, bringing welfare to all; O heaven and earth; O broad midspace;
Let us worship Bṛhaspati with an oblation, svāhā!
May every mortal choose the friendship of the divine leader;
Everyone begs for wealth; may he choose splendor; may he prosper, svāhā!
O Indra and Agni, heaven and earth, waters, plants, broad midspace, lords of consecration: approve my consecration; lords of ascetic fervor: [approve my] ascetic fervor, and Agni!
O divine Sūrya, establish food and strength!
O divine Savitṛ, you are the lord of consecration among consecrations;
Protect me being thus;
Protect me up to the completion!
